# Canonical names for git log, shortlog and blame
# (https://git-scm.com/docs/gitmailmap). Format:
#   Proper Name <proper@email> Commit Name <commit@email>
# A line with just "Proper Name <commit@email>" renames every commit from that
# email. Add a line when someone commits under a new name or address.

